# onyx port 0010: host tests for the BootShim and the SEC handoff guard
#
# Scope: mock ABI compiled on the host (no EDK2 build, no hardware) for
#   OnyxHandoff.c, plus the BootShim source/compile regression in
#   Tests/test_bootshim.py.
# Limits: fixtures, not device evidence. They prove the code paths and the
#   board-map cross-check, not that the firmware boots.
diff --git a/Tests/OnyxHandoff/onyx_host_mock.c b/Tests/OnyxHandoff/onyx_host_mock.c
